              },
              "marks": 1
            },
            "er": [],
            "aiSupplement": {
              "explanation": [
                {
                  "text": "Recombinant describes the combination of DNA from distinct sources into one DNA molecule; copying DNA alone does not establish that combination.",
                  "refs": [
                    "ms:a.i#1",
